    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d337">

                <pb facs="1393" n="1235" sameAs="frus:frus1906p2/pg1235"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to the President of
                    Peru</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-09-20"><hi rendition="#italic">September 20,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am glad to receive your telegram in regard to the good effect of Secretary
                    Root’s visit, and trust that not only this pleasing occasion, but all that
                    concerns the intercourse of the two countries may tend to their mutual
                    friendship and esteem.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Theodore
                    Roosevelt.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
